            <div xml:id="d137-a1">

                <pb facs="0242" n="162" xml:id="pg162"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mc Wade to Mr. Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Canton</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-02-27"><hi rendition="#italic">February 27,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Learnt almost midnight rebellion Nan-ning. Kuangsi missionaries ordered by me
                    request governor Kuangsi leave immediately under pledged escort to Wuchow.
                    Details later.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">McWade</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
